"""
Proof-of-Concept: TLS Cipher Suite Downgrade Attack

This script demonstrates how an on-path attacker can intercept a TLS ClientHello,
modify the cipher suite list to force negotiation of a weak cipher suite, and
observe the resulting connection behavior.

Vulnerability: TLS implementations that fail to strictly enforce HTTP/2 prohibited
cipher suite lists may allow connections with weak ciphers like CBC-based suites.

Note: This is a demonstration script for educational purposes only.
"""

